=2 Walkthrough
\**{c=red:Note:}** This Mission is optional and can be skipped by trading enough {p:Crystals|Crystal} to the {p:Conquest NPC}.
Trade enough {p:Crystals|Crystal} to the {p:Conquest NPC} to raise your Rank bar and unlock the Mission, then accept it from the {n:Gate Guard}.
* Obtain a {@i:Hare Meat|4358} {i:Hare Meat|Hare Meat|4358}.
* Speak to {n:Davyad} (K-6) in {z:Bastok Mines} inside the corner house on the upper deck.
* Head to {z:Gusgen Mines} (or Survival Guide, Zulkheim Region) from {z:Konschtat Highlands} and proceed to (J-7).
** You will need {s:Sneak} or {@i:Silent Oil|4165} {i:Silent Oil|Silent Oil|4165} in here unless you are of sufficient level, /check the monsters to make sure they are incredibly easy prey or too weak.
* Once inside the Mines, follow these directions to arrive at the pond at (J-7):
** At the first three-way intersection, take a right (East).
** At the next intersection, take a left (North).
** At the fork, take a right (East), and then another right (East) at the next intersection.
** You should be at the pond at (J-7).
*** Take caution of {m:Smothered Schmidt} who spawns in the same area at either 0:00, 1:00, or 2:00 when the siren in the zone sounds.
*** Schmidt was easily killed as a lvl 38 NIN with 4 summoned {p:Trusts}.
*** Wait around for it to depop if it is up. Schmidt doesn't drop anything worthwhile.
* Trade the {@i:Hare Meat|4358} {i:Hare Meat|Hare Meat|4358} to the **???** to spawn {m:Blind Moby}, a {p:Pugil} NM.
** It will drop an item called {@i:Glocolite|563} {i:Glocolite|Glocolite|563} (**{p:G|Guaranteed (100%)}**). If you're in a party with other players, everyone doing this Mission will require one, so defeat the NM as many times as required.
** You must wait 3 minute between pops.
* Trade the {@i:Glocolite|563} {i:Glocolite|Glocolite|563} to any {n:Gate Guard} to finish the Mission.

